<title>USA: N.Y. Local Govt Corp bonds repriced, ylds lowered.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Local Govt Corp bonds repriced, ylds lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced New York Local Government Assistance Corp's $243 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities and leaving the top yield in 2015 unchanged at 5.40 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
